"Local cache removal preserves offline clipboard history. Deleting the Nexus iCloud zone removes its cloud records, but another device can re-upload old copies unless sync is disabled there." = "清理云端缓存不会删除本机离线剪贴板历史。删除 Nexus iCloud 存储区后，如果其他设备仍开启同步，旧记录可能再次上传。";
