"Your offline clipboard history stays on this device. Cloud cache, queued changes and server cursor are cleared without network access." = "本机离线剪贴板历史将保留。云端缓存、待上传变更和服务端游标会在不联网的情况下清理。";
"Erase private Nexus iCloud clipboard zone" = "删除 Nexus 的 iCloud 私有剪贴板存储区";
